description	"Sith Airborne Trooper

Sith infantry scouts who use light equipment for the best mobility and adaptability.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Vibroknife
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
- Thermal Grenades (2)
- Sith Light Pistol (1)
-- 5%- Damage
-- 10%- RoF

^8Attributes:
- Assemble (1)
- Dexterity (1) ^3[CS1]
- Faster Skill Cooldowns (15% reduction)
- Binoculars
- Tracking Beacon
- Environmental Suit (1)
- Tracking Darts (4) ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4]

^8Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]"